00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.760
Battery supply chains rarely move in straight lines.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:34.000
Yet, Tesla's expanding relationship with EL-E's in Taiwan shows how incremental supplier growth

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.200
can quietly reshape cost structures.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:41.340
The Taiwanese firm's capacity increase is tied directly to Tesla's sell demand,

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:47.520
