00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:56.440
This arrangement reduces single-point exposure compared with relying on one or two dominant

00:07:56.440 --> 00:08:02.180
sell makers, but it also requires Tesla to maintain technical oversight across more sites.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:08.300
The practical result is a slower but steadier path to lower perco-tabuage costs,

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:13.200
